  (footprint "temper:CST2010" (version 20231120) (generator temper-hand) (layer "F.Cu")
    (tedit ac7ff9f0) (tstamp c30f8de5-8eda-b7d7-0947-7aecd6438bfc)
    (at 134.98 165.02)
    (descr "Coilcraft CST2010 SMT current sense transformer (CST2010-100L, 1:100, 47A sensed, AEC-Q200 Grade 1). Land pattern hand-built from the official datasheet recommended land pattern (Coilcraft Document 1100-2, https://www.coilcraft.com/getmedia/b18378dd-6d9f-439a-8dac-df3739bdf594/cst2010datasheet.pdf): two large primary pads 7.24x4.27mm on 11.24mm vertical centers; two columns of five 2.34x1.19mm pads on 2.54mm pitch, column centers 9.04mm each side of the primary pad axis. Body 13.0x14.55mm max, height 10.50mm max, lead-tip span 19.91mm max. PAD NUMBERING matches the placed atopile component CST2010_100L (P1/P2 primary = pads 1/2, S1/S2 secondary = pads 3/4), NOT Coilcraft's own pin numbers -- mapping: footprint pad 1 = Coilcraft pin 11 (top primary tab), pad 2 = Coilcraft pin 12 (bottom primary tab), pad 3 = Coilcraft pin 2 (secondary start), pad 4 = Coilcraft pin 4 (secondary finish; datasheet note 4 defines the secondary between Coilcraft pins 2 and 4). Remaining leads (Coilcraft pins 1, 3, 5 on the left column and 10..6 on the right column) are electrically unused but must be soldered for mechanical strength; they are pads 5..12 here and carry no net. Silkscreen dot marks the Coilcraft pin-1 corner (top-left), matching the dot on the part body for assembly orientation.")
